---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Home" activePage="home">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero-tag">Constitutional Law · Malaysia · Edition I</div>
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div>
          <h1>Understanding <span class="ital">Bail</span>: Your Rights, The Rules, and The Exceptions</h1>
          <p class="hero-sub-label">Right of Bail: Presumption of Innocence</p>
          <p class="hero-sub">A study of the bailable, non-bailable and unbailable categories under Malaysian criminal justice — and the constitutional principles that govern them.</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="crest" aria-label="Study record">
          <dl>
            <div class="crest-row"><dt>Volume</dt><dd>I</dd></div>
            <div class="crest-row"><dt>Topic</dt><dd>Bail</dd></div>
            <div class="crest-row"><dt>Jurisdiction</dt><dd>Malaysia</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <div class="crest-divider"></div>
          <div class="crest-num">06<small>Group Members</small></div>
          <div class="crest-divider"></div>
          <dl>
            <div class="crest-row"><dt>Class</dt><dd>B</dd></div>
            <div class="crest-row"><dt>Group</dt><dd>07</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Definition -->
  <section class="definition">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="def-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">§ 01 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Definition</div>
          <div class="kicker">Bail</div>
        </div>
        <div class="measure">
          <p>Bail is the temporary release of an accused person from custody while they wait for their trial, subject to conditions set by the court.</p>
          <p>It ensures that the accused person attends their court dates, while protecting the fundamental constitutional principle that a person is innocent until proven guilty.</p>
          <blockquote class="pullquote">"Bail is not merely a procedural mechanism for release. It is the vital constitutional bridge between the state's need to maintain public security and an individual's fundamental right to liberty."</blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Scope -->
  <section class="scope">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="def-grid" style="margin-bottom:50px;">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">§ 02 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Scope</div>
          <h2 style="margin:0;">Jurisprudence of Bail</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="measure">
          <p style="font-size:21px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin:0 0 18px;">This platform translates the complex laws surrounding bail in Malaysia into clear, accessible knowledge for every citizen.</p>
          <p style="font-size:18px; color:var(--muted); margin:0;">Navigating the Bailable, Non-Bailable, and Unbailable under Malaysian Criminal Justice.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="scope-grid">
        <article class="scope-cell">
          <div class="num">I &nbsp;·&nbsp; Bailable</div>
          <h3>The Three Tiers of Justice</h3>
          <p>The Criminal Procedure Code divides offences into bailable, non-bailable, and unbailable categories — each carrying different levels of judicial discretion.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="scope-cell">
          <div class="num">II &nbsp;·&nbsp; Security</div>
          <h3>State's Security vs. Human Rights</h3>
          <p>Constitutional tensions between SOSMA's strict bail prohibitions and the fundamental right to liberty under Article 5 of the Federal Constitution.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="scope-cell">
          <div class="num">III &nbsp;·&nbsp; Case Law</div>
          <h3>Malaysian Case Law</h3>
          <p>Court decisions navigating legal gaps — from compassionate bail for capital offences to the limits of executive power over acquitted persons.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="scope-cell">
          <div class="num">IV &nbsp;·&nbsp; Procedure</div>
          <h3>Practical Bail Process</h3>
          <p>Step-by-step guidance on the bail procedure — from the courtroom to the Kaunter Jaminan and payment through the e-Jamin system.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Members -->
  <section class="members">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="members-head">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">§ 03 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Authors</div>
          <h2 style="margin:0;">Group 7, Class B</h2>
        </div>
        <p style="margin:0; color:var(--muted); font-family:var(--sans); font-size:14px; line-height:1.6;">A team of six undergraduate authors compiled the research, illustrations, FAQ and game companion for this volume on the constitutional framework of bail.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="members-grid">
        <div class="member">
          <div class="avatar">
            <span class="mono">MS</span>
            <img src="/images/members/monica.jpg" alt="Monica Selesh Anak Sawan" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <p class="name">Monica Selesh Anak Sawan</p>
          <span class="id">No. 284271</span>
        </div>
        <div class="member">
          <div class="avatar">
            <span class="mono">NA</span>
            <img src="/images/members/aisya.png" alt="Nur Aisya Kamilia Binti Rezaki" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <p class="name">Nur Aisya Kamilia Binti Rezaki</p>
          <span class="id">No. 284374</span>
        </div>
        <div class="member">
          <div class="avatar">
            <span class="mono">NZ</span>
            <img src="/images/members/nourel.jpg" alt="Nourel Ain Binti Zaidi" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <p class="name">Nourel Ain Binti Zaidi</p>
          <span class="id">No. 288094</span>
        </div>
        <div class="member">
          <div class="avatar">
            <span class="mono">NI</span>
            <img src="/images/members/imanah.jpg" alt="Nur Imanah Binti Idrus" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <p class="name">Nur Imanah Binti Idrus</p>
          <span class="id">No. 288236</span>
        </div>
        <div class="member">
          <div class="avatar">
            <span class="mono">NB</span>
            <img src="/images/members/nurin.jpg" alt="Nurin Ilyana Binti Bidin" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <p class="name">Nurin Ilyana Binti Bidin</p>
          <span class="id">No. 288304</span>
        </div>
        <div class="member">
          <div class="avatar">
            <span class="mono">AK</span>
            <img src="/images/members/arvind.jpg" alt="Arvind A/L Kanagasabai" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <p class="name">Arvind A/L Kanagasabai</p>
          <span class="id">No. 294358</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
/* Hero sub-label */
.hero-sub-label {
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: .26em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--gold-deep);
  margin: 28px 0 10px;
  font-weight: 500;
}

/* Definition */
.definition {
  padding: 100px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
}
.def-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr; gap: 80px;
}
.def-grid .kicker { padding-top: 8px; }
.def-grid p { margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ink-soft); }
.def-grid p:first-of-type::first-letter {
  font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 78px; line-height: .85; font-weight: 500;
  float: left; padding: 6px 14px 0 0; color: var(--ink); font-style: normal;
}

/* Scope */
.scope { padding: 100px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
.scope-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 1px; background: var(--rule); border: 1px solid var(--rule);
}
.scope-cell { background: var(--bg); padding: 36px 30px 32px; }
.scope-cell .num {
  font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .2em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold-deep);
}
.scope-cell h3 { margin: 18px 0 12px; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 500; }
.scope-cell p { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ink-soft); }

/* Members */
.members { padding: 100px 0; }
.members-head {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px;
  align-items: end; margin-bottom: 60px;
}
.members-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1px; background: var(--rule); border: 1px solid var(--rule);
}
.member {
  background: var(--bg);
  padding: 34px 28px 28px;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start;
}
.avatar {
  width: 110px; height: 110px; border-radius: 50%;
  border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  display: grid; place-items: center;
  font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 26px; color: var(--ink);
  background: var(--surface);
  margin-bottom: 22px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .02em;
  overflow: hidden; position: relative;
}
.avatar img {
  position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover; object-position: center top;
  display: block;
  filter: grayscale(.15) contrast(1.02);
  transition: filter .25s ease, transform .4s ease;
}
.member:hover .avatar img { filter: none; transform: scale(1.03); }
.avatar .mono { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.avatar:has(img) .mono { display: none; }
.member .name {
  font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--ink);
  margin: 0 0 4px;
}
.member .id {
  font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .22em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted);
}

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .def-grid, .members-head { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
  .scope-grid, .members-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .definition, .scope, .members { padding: 60px 0; }
}
@media (min-width: 901px) and (max-width: 1100px) {
  .scope-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
</style>
